# Enterprise System Configuration Report

**API Version:** {{ apiVersion }}

---

## System Metadata

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **Name** | {{ metadata.name }} |
| **Version** | {{ metadata.version }} |
| **Created** | {{ metadata.created }} |
| **Last Modified** | {{ metadata.lastModified }} |
| **Tags** | {{ metadata.tags | array.join ", " }} |

---

## Database Configuration

### Primary Database

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **Host** | {{ configuration.database.primary.host }} |
| **Port** | {{ configuration.database.primary.port }} |
| **Database Name** | {{ configuration.database.primary.name }} |
| **SSL Enabled** | {{ configuration.database.primary.ssl }} |
| **Pool Size** | {{ configuration.database.primary.poolSize }} |
| **Timeout (ms)** | {{ configuration.database.primary.timeout }} |

### Database Replicas

| Host | Port | Region |
|------|------|--------|
{{- for replica in configuration.database.replicas }}
| {{ replica.host }} | {{ replica.port }} | {{ replica.region }} |
{{- end }}

---

## Cache Configuration (Redis)

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **Enabled** | {{ configuration.cache.redis.enabled }} |
| **TTL (seconds)** | {{ configuration.cache.redis.ttl }} |
| **Max Memory** | {{ configuration.cache.redis.maxMemory }} |
| **Nodes** | {{ configuration.cache.redis.nodes | array.join ", " }} |

---

## Microservices

{{- for service in configuration.services }}

### {{ service.name }}

**Type:** {{ service.type }} | **Replicas:** {{ service.replicas }}

#### Resources

| Resource | Allocation |
|----------|------------|
| **CPU** | {{ service.resources.cpu }} |
| **Memory** | {{ service.resources.memory }} |
| **Storage** | {{ service.resources.storage }} |

#### API Endpoints

| Endpoint |
|----------|
{{- for endpoint in service.endpoints }}
| `{{ endpoint }}` |
{{- end }}

{{- if service.dependencies }}
**Dependencies:** {{ service.dependencies | array.join ", " }}
{{- end }}

{{- if service.queue }}
**Message Queue:**
- Type: {{ service.queue.type }}
- Host: {{ service.queue.host }}
- VHost: {{ service.queue.vhost }}
- Queues: {{ service.queue.queues | array.join ", " }}
{{- end }}

{{- if service.healthCheck }}
**Health Check:**
- Path: `{{ service.healthCheck.path }}`
- Interval: {{ service.healthCheck.interval }}s
- Timeout: {{ service.healthCheck.timeout }}s
- Retries: {{ service.healthCheck.retries }}
{{- end }}

---
{{- end }}

## Monitoring & Observability

### Metrics Collection

#### Prometheus

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **Enabled** | {{ monitoring.metrics.prometheus.enabled }} |
| **Scrape Interval** | {{ monitoring.metrics.prometheus.scrapeInterval }} |
| **Endpoints** | {{ monitoring.metrics.prometheus.endpoints | array.join ", " }} |

#### Grafana Dashboards

| Dashboard |
|-----------|
{{- for dashboard in monitoring.metrics.grafana.dashboards }}
| {{ dashboard }} |
{{- end }}

### Logging Configuration

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **Log Level** | {{ monitoring.logging.level }} |
| **Outputs** | {{ monitoring.logging.outputs | array.join ", " }} |
| **Elasticsearch Host** | {{ monitoring.logging.elasticsearch.host }} |
| **Index Name** | {{ monitoring.logging.elasticsearch.index }} |
| **Retention Period** | {{ monitoring.logging.elasticsearch.retention }} |

### Alert Rules

| Alert Name | Condition | Severity | Notification Channels |
|------------|-----------|----------|----------------------|
{{- for alert in monitoring.alerts }}
| {{ alert.name }} | `{{ alert.condition }}` | **{{ alert.severity }}** | {{ alert.channels | array.join ", " }} |
{{- end }}

