## Security Configuration

### Authentication (JWT)

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **Type** | {{ security.authentication.type | string.upcase }} |
| **Issuer** | {{ security.authentication.issuer }} |
| **Audience** | {{ security.authentication.audience }} |
| **Token Expiry** | {{ security.authentication.tokenExpiry }}s ({{ (security.authentication.tokenExpiry / 60) | math.floor }} minutes) |
| **Refresh Token Expiry** | {{ security.authentication.refreshTokenExpiry }}s ({{ (security.authentication.refreshTokenExpiry / 86400) | math.floor }} days) |

### Authorization (RBAC)

**Role-Based Access Control:** {{ security.authorization.rbac.enabled ? "Enabled" : "Disabled" }}

| Role | Permissions |
|------|-------------|
{{- for role in security.authorization.rbac.roles }}
| **{{ role.name }}** | {{ role.permissions | array.join ", " }} |
{{- end }}

### Encryption

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **At Rest** | {{ security.encryption.atRest ? "✅ Enabled" : "❌ Disabled" }} |
| **In Transit** | {{ security.encryption.inTransit ? "✅ Enabled" : "❌ Disabled" }} |
| **Algorithm** | {{ security.encryption.algorithm }} |

