## Summary Statistics

{{- total_replicas = 0 }}
{{- for service in configuration.services }}
  {{- total_replicas = total_replicas + service.replicas }}
{{- end }}

- **Total Microservices:** {{ configuration.services | array.size }}
- **Total Service Replicas:** {{ total_replicas }}
- **Total Database Nodes:** {{ 1 + (configuration.database.replicas | array.size) }} (1 primary + {{ configuration.database.replicas | array.size }} replicas)
- **Total Cache Nodes:** {{ configuration.cache.redis.nodes | array.size }}
- **Total Alert Rules:** {{ monitoring.alerts | array.size }}
- **Security Roles Defined:** {{ security.authorization.rbac.roles | array.size }}

